WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
MemeBox brings memes, music, pictures and camera effects into browser calls.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Join a browser call. Click 😂 for a random meme; right-click it to choose one.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Search your library, save favourites and use Alt+1–9. Alt+0 stops all playback.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Explore all 16 tunes, including three Phonk originals. Preview extras privately; choose who hears your music.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Press Play in the player. For Everyone in call, select this player tab and enable Share tab audio.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Choose a picture, preview it and press Add. Caption and Read caption aloud are optional.

7
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Pick a character and outfit. Preview its signature action, waving, dancing and reactions.

8
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Optional Follow me uses local face and hand models. It supports selected gestures, not general sign language.

9
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Try filters, studio lights and light shows. Your camera must be on for others to see them.

10
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Try voice effects and auto-duck. Keep the meeting mic unmuted so others hear the mix.

11
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Party mode plays a selected line at a clock time or interval while your call mic is connected.

12
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Passes count only while on in a connected call. Unused time never expires; owned extras stay on your key.

13
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Preview first, then join your browser call. Your saved content stays on this device when you update.
